The IPK file is intended for ASURA CPRNT and may be installed by:
1) uploading the IPK to the system using SCP
2) logging into the system using SSH
3) invoking "opkg install hobart-nowserving_XXX_arm.ipk"
4) rebooting the system

The DEB file is intended for Utilite systems and may be installed by:
1) uploading the DEB to the system using SCP
2) logging into the system using SSH
3) invoking "dpkg -i hobart-nowserving_XXX_armel.deb"
4) rebooting the system
